This folder holds the certificate credential files (PDF or image) referenced
by the "file" field of entries in data/content.json's "certificates" array.

Certificates don't need a file added manually — upload them straight from
the admin panel's Certificates tab (admin.html), which commits the file
here via the GitHub Contents API and fills in the entry's file path once
the upload succeeds.

Delete this file once at least one real certificate file has been added —
it exists only so git tracks this otherwise-empty directory.
